[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-secai-ai-scholarship-2026-in-germany-fully-funded-302":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":13,"notifiedBy":10,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},302,"secai-ai-scholarship-2026-in-germany-fully-funded-302","Secai Ai Scholarship 2026 In Germany: Fully Funded","\u003Cp>The SECAI AI Scholarship is a fully funded opportunity in AI-related fields in Germany that provides a monthly stipend of €934, targeted mentoring, and industry networking.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>In this post, the full details of the eligibility, benefits, timeline, and application procedure will be provided.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>SECAI AI Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: SECAI\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-europe\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Germany\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> | ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>€934 Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Industry Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: June 30, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>SECAI AI Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>SECAI scholarships were created to support outstanding students who intend to study AI or a related field at TU Dresden or Leipzig University.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>AI is viewed as an interdisciplinary undertaking that requires talents in \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fsecai-ai-scholarship\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>computer science\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa>, engineering, mathematics, social \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fsecai-ai-scholarship\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>science\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa>, law, the natural \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fsecai-ai-scholarship\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>sciences\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa>, and application areas such as medicine.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The scholarships cover living expenses in Germany to allow students to focus on their studies, kick-start their research career, and build their professional network.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The scholarship is mainly based on academic excellence, but also aims to improve internationalization and diversity in AI-related teaching programs. Women in STEM subjects are particularly encouraged to apply.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Special personal circumstances are taken into account, for example if students are systematically disadvantaged or prosecuted in their home countries, or are refugees of war.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>SECAI AI Scholarship Germany Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>SECAI AI Scholarship Germany offers:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>€934 Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Industry Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Foreign students may be entitled to a monthly family allowance.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>SECAI Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the SECAI Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>They currently are or soon will be students of TU Dresden or Leipzig University at Master level (it is possible to apply for the scholarship in parallel to applying for a Master’s program; this requires two independent applications).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The content of their studies are closely related to the research areas of SECAI. This includes but is not limited to studies in the following programs:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002FM.Sc\">M.Sc\u003C\u002Fa>. Computer Science (TUD)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002FM.Sc\">M.Sc\u003C\u002Fa>. Computational Modeling and Simulation (TUD) in tracks \u003Cem>Applied Artificial Intelligence\u003C\u002Fem> and \u003Cem>Computational Life Science\u003C\u002Fem>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002FM.Sc\">M.Sc\u003C\u002Fa>. Data Science (UL)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002FM.Sc\">M.Sc\u003C\u002Fa>. Nanoelectronic Systems (TUD)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002FM.Sc\">M.Sc\u003C\u002Fa>. Bioinformatics (Bioinformatik, UL)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002FM.Sc\">M.Sc\u003C\u002Fa>. Medical Informatics (Medizininformatik, UL)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Moreover, students of other programs may apply if they have specialized towards an AI-related topic by choice of their elective courses or project\u002Fthesis topics. Relevant study programs include:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002FM.Sc\">M.Sc\u003C\u002Fa>. or Diploma programs in Computer Science\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>LL.M. (Master of Laws) studies with a focus on legal aspects of AI\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>M.A. studies at TUD and UL with a focus on human and societal dimensions of AI\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"http:\u002F\u002FM.Sc\">M.Sc\u003C\u002Fa>. studies in psychology with a focus on socio-technical systems and human-machine interaction\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>All applicants must demonstrate an above-average academic track record, typically with a cumulative grade point average of 1.7 or better (after conversion to the German grading system). Exceptions may be made in case of adverse personal circumstances.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>DAAD SECAI AI Scholarship Required Documents\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the DAAD SECAI AI Scholarship , you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete Application Form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic Transcripts\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Bachelors\u002F Diploma Certificate (Masters)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Personal Statement\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>CV\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for DAAD SECAI AI Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the SECAI AI Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Submit your application via the this application form: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fbildungsportal.sachsen.de\u002Fumfragen\u002Flimesurvey\u002Findex.php\u002F188897\">Apply here\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Begin your application by clicking on the button below.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: June 30th, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>APPLY HERE: \u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fbildungsportal.sachsen.de\u002Fumfragen\u002Flimesurvey\u002Findex.php\u002F188897\">\u003Cstrong>https:\u002F\u002Fbildungsportal.sachsen.de\u002Fumfragen\u002Flimesurvey\u002Findex.php\u002F188897\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","LINKSKOOL",16,"published",0,"2026-06-23 20:19:08",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fsecai-ai-scholarship-2026-in-germany-fully-funded\u002F6a3adc2c52b614.64346149_screenshot 2026-06-23 200748.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fsecai-ai-scholarship-2026-in-germany-fully-funded\u002F6a3adc2c52b614.64346149_screenshot%202026-06-23%20200748.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,38,48,58,67,76,85,93,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted"